{"question_id": "qst_0421", "answer": "According to the runbooks, the default handshake token TTL differs slightly between two versions of the protocol:\n\n- **Document 1 (2025 version):** default valid for **120 seconds** (configurable)\n- **Document 2 (earlier version):** valid for **3 minutes (180 seconds)**\n\nThe most current guidance (Document 1) specifies a default TTL of **120 seconds**.", "document_ids": ["dsid_9f2e6aa7f6c14b1db1c6f922a1d4b4d7", "dsid_b8ab9778e36543159da49dba3ad9c76d", "dsid_69f06c84b8654bc6b3577e4a3320a48d", "dsid_50c7ffed7df94450ad975b3e51e241cb", "dsid_8c6725755f834295b022783b1ba64fae", "dsid_8e9d8eff077e46a2b0e75d3e66f90f69", "dsid_9b6eee23377b449fbcf40decdef7bad1", "dsid_a7113ef4d5844223a4586ea4e5acf56e", "dsid_b3adc31adaf2420fa06b148a4e02d176", "dsid_574db9ceb8db445588666851a1422aea"]}
{"question_id": "qst_0422", "answer": "According to the Confluence document (dsid_8733ed2132dc4232b2797c1d9a167cb9), the previous \"super-admin retention override\" is deprecated. As of the 2026-03 update, retrieving records beyond standard retention requires an explicit Legal Hold, represented by a `legal_hold_id`, and is only allowed for tenants with Legal Hold enabled. All uses of `legal_hold_id` are logged to the immutable audit stream with a ticket reference.", "document_ids": ["dsid_8733ed2132dc4232b2797c1d9a167cb9", "dsid_9cde32cd0645459b80ec513df27d1eb6", "dsid_23bb2fb712e14b26bc6a8c6ec1871fc0", "dsid_cc4728cc46b24f608b510abd20edf5e3", "dsid_62bf7e4042234bd4b9f17d42f9bdf724", "dsid_04bf2110eaf3453b9cfd692503da5e65", "dsid_d17f4560982e421b9e26058747d3b8d1", "dsid_419f9d6ab19541fd9801a28e44d86da1", "dsid_c8279e9fca7a43549c0cc3cad88e3ddd", "dsid_6dc0069b87c5494abcb0455668f3f7af"]}
